  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerate to Demonstrate (A2D)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The A2D programme contributes to the UK&#x2019;s &#xA3;1bn Ayrton Fund commitment to accelerate clean energy innovation in developing countries. A2D will focus on developing innovative technology-based solutions particularly through transformational &#x201C;lighthouse&#x201D; pilot demonstration projects in four thematic areas: critical minerals, clean hydrogen, industrial decarbonisation and smart energy.</narrative>
  </description>
